title: 'If another vehicle’s lights are too bright:'
pid: a5fd4730-a04d-4d19-908e-eb07ea21a565
body: |2-
  - Do not look directly into the oncoming headlights.
  - Look toward the right edge of your lane.
  - Watch the oncoming vehicle out of the corner of your eye.
  - Do not [avenge] by keeping your high-beam headlights on.
